---
import Timeline from '../../../figs/Timeline.tsx';
import '@fontsource/inter/400.css'; import '@fontsource/inter/600.css'; import '@fontsource/inter/700.css';
import '@fontsource/jetbrains-mono/500.css'; import '@fontsource/jetbrains-mono/600.css';
import '../../../figs/timeline.css';
---
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>开场时间轴 · 预览</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;background:#f6f2ea;color:#2f2b25;font-family:Inter,"PingFang SC",sans-serif}
main{max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;padding:56px 32px 80px}
.eb{font:600 12px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#c0612f}
h1{font-size:34px;margin:12px 0 8px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.lead{color:#7a7264;margin:0 0 36px;font-size:16px}
h2{font:600 12.5px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#8a8273;margin:48px 0 14px;text-transform:uppercase}
figcaption{font-size:14px;color:#8a8273;margin-top:12px;line-height:1.6}
</style></head><body><main>
<div class="eb">FIGURE PREVIEW · OPENING</div>
<h1>后训练的演进：模型是锚点，方法是主角</h1>
<p class="lead">悬停或点击节点聚焦；悬停底部「监督信号来源」高亮对应技术。带 * 的节点悬停可看注释；来源见 docs/timeline-sources.md。</p>
<h2 id="a">变体 A · 纸面浅色</h2>
<figure style="margin:0"><Timeline client:visible variant="A" />
<figcaption>图 1　后训练方法随代表模型的演进。标签颜色表示监督信号来源：从人写示范，到人类偏好、可验证结果、环境反馈与教师模型。</figcaption></figure>
<h2 id="b">变体 B · 深色 + 信号色带</h2>
<figure style="margin:0"><Timeline client:visible variant="B" /></figure>
</main></body></html>
